Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 10:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] MediaGuard: pre-import decision specification

New IImportDecisionEngineSpecification that asks MediaGuard to accept,
reject or defer a downloaded file before import. Files already inside
the series folder (rescans) are not sent. Rejected/deferred downloads
stay in the queue and are retried by the normal completed download
handling cycle.
